{"title": "Rampage", "pageid": 4434, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Rampage", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Explosion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/300px-Generic_Explosion.webp, /w/images/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/300px-Generic_Explosion.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Rampage</b> is a passive feature available to some <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">Gnolls</a> that gives them the ability to quickly move and bite a foe after downing a creature.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When a <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">Gnoll</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Downs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">Downs</a> a creature with a melee attack, the gnoll can use a <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Action</a> to move up to half its <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> and make a bite attack. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Rampage\"> Condition: Rampage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rampage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rampage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Rampage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Rampage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Rampage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Rampage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Rampage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Rampage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rampage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Rampage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Rampage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Rampage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rampage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rampage (Condition)\">Rampage</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>When a gnoll Downs a creature with a melee attack on its turn, it regains 1 bonus action and half of its <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">movement speed</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/%27Barnabus%27\" title=\"'Barnabus'\">'Barnabus'</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/%27Timothy%27\" title=\"'Timothy'\">'Timothy'</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/%27Tomelia%27\" title=\"'Tomelia'\">'Tomelia'</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll_Fang_of_Yeenoghu\" title=\"Gnoll Fang of Yeenoghu\">Gnoll Fang of Yeenoghu</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll_Hunter\" title=\"Gnoll Hunter\">Gnoll Hunter</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Newborn_Gnoll\" title=\"Newborn Gnoll\">Newborn Gnoll</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Despite the description, this features lacks any code to allow a Gnoll to bite using a bonus action.</li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">When <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">downing</a> a creature with a melee attack, can use a <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus action\">bonus action</a> to move up to half its <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">movement speed</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Bite_(Gnoll)\" title=\"Bite (Gnoll)\">bite</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715152000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1145/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8953/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3478/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 565/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 687730/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.812      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   41.812      1 -total\n 31.15%   13.026      1 Template:Cond\n 24.92%   10.421      2 Template:Icon_link\n 23.99%   10.032      2 Template:Icon_text\n 22.13%    9.252      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 21.22%    8.871      6 Template:Trim\n 18.58%    7.768      1 Template:Condition\n 16.73%    6.995      2 Template:Ifempty\n 15.39%    6.436      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4434-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715152000 and revision id 388318. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}